{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §4.2, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.12 (qualified names, proposed)"
  description: """
    A data document's name resolves in the governing schema as a schema's own does: `book` is a value of the
    namespace type `orders`, its further segment selects the key `first`, and the value there is of `orders`'s
    `value_type`, `order`.
    """
  valid: _
